<section class="av_textblock_section av-m4h81onp-b3a5d0a13a5f155a5cfb6df70a178676" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p>NeuroStar uses transcranial magnetic stimulation (TMS) to target key areas of the brain that are underactive in people with depression. Unlike electroconvulsive therapy (ECT), NeuroStar TMS Therapy is a non-invasive treatment that does not involve anesthesia or sedation.</p>
<p>The leading scientific theory suggests that depression is caused by an imbalance in the brain’s neurotransmitters, which are chemical messengers that send signals between brain cells. This therapy aims to correct this imbalance, offering new hope for those <a href="depression-treatment.php">struggling with depression</a>.</p>
</div></section></div><div class="av-flex-placeholder"></div><div class="flex_column av-blcx7-8e298f9275f4a7f8d2086b1d99dd1a96 av_one_half avia-builder-el-14 el_after_av_one_half avia-builder-el-last flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-bottom column-top-margin"><div class="avia-image-container av-m4ebrt5y-e0199e7cad5d73623a0abbf2c097d9cb av-styling- avia-align-center avia-builder-el-15 avia-builder-el-no-sibling" itemprop="image" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/ImageObject"><div class="avia-image-container-inner"><div class="avia-image-overlay-wrap"><img alt="NeuroStar TMS therapy in Miami at Casa Privee. An innovative approach to neuropsychiatry for treating depression, anxiety, OCD and more." class="wp-image-1288 avia-img-lazy-loading-not-1288 avia_image" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" height="571" itemprop="thumbnailUrl" sizes="(max-width: 797px) 100vw, 797px" src="<?php echo $basePath; ?>wp-content/uploads/2025/02/tms-therapy-miami.webp" srcset="<?php echo $basePath; ?>wp-content/uploads/2025/02/tms-therapy-miami.webp 797w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/02/tms-therapy-miami-300x215.webp 300w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/02/tms-therapy-miami-768x550.webp 768w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/02/tms-therapy-miami-260x185.webp 260w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/02/tms-therapy-miami-705x505.webp 705w" title="NeuroStar TMS therapy in Miami at Casa Privee. An innovative approach to neuropsychiatry for treating depression, anxiety, OCD and more." width="797"/></div></div></div></div></div><!--close column table wrapper. Autoclose: 1 -->
